   "subject": "Re: [r-inla] a question of separable space-time model",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Hi,</div><div>In the Cameletti et al case, the covariance of \\xi also takes a product form; it&#39;s the product of a Matern covariance in space and an exponential covariance in time.</div><div>That model was specified using an &quot;ar1&quot; &quot;group&quot; model, which defines a kronecker product precision matrix model, which exactly translates into a product of covariance functions.</div><div>See ?control.group for a list of other supported models to use in that kind of construction.</div><div>For more general models, you can define your own using the rgeneric model framework (search the list for previous mentions of rgeneric models)</div><div><br></div><div>Finn<br></div><div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\">On 29 May 2018 at 18:00, Neo Lyh <span dir=\"ltr\">&lt;<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">lyh...@gmail.com</a>&gt;</span> wrote:<br></div></div></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Dear INLA developers<div><br><div>It is clear that INLA can deal with space time model with separable variance covariance matrix. </div><div>E.g. In Cameletti&#39;s case, they use an additive form to capture the real spatiotemporal effects.<br></div><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Tav5VYC_icc/Ww2EPDx3hdI/AAAAAAAAETU/jNlFp5Yz4xgeG6vZQyWao1Sk7tml_y5_ACLcBGAs/s1600/1.gif\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Tav5VYC_icc/Ww2EPDx3hdI/AAAAAAAAETU/jNlFp5Yz4xgeG6vZQyWao1Sk7tml_y5_ACLcBGAs/s1600/1.gif&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792443273039000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0lfJVAvc3ThLUxfAyAOoWv\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Tav5VYC_icc/Ww2EPDx3hdI/AAAAAAAAETU/jNlFp5Yz4xgeG6vZQyWao1Sk7tml_y5_ACLcBGAs/s1600/1.gif\" border=\"0\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Sn6AnWInF7I/Ww2EWH2HvHI/AAAAAAAAETY/xUbnNid5B1g2R7v_yjm3lD7L_rpRZpt4wCLcBGAs/s1600/2.gif\" style=\"margin-left:1em;margin-right:1em\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Sn6AnWInF7I/Ww2EWH2HvHI/AAAAAAAAETY/xUbnNid5B1g2R7v_yjm3lD7L_rpRZpt4wCLcBGAs/s1600/2.gif&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792443273039000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2kDmyEEQ6y2CGQLVlpdw-3\"><img src=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-Sn6AnWInF7I/Ww2EWH2HvHI/AAAAAAAAETY/xUbnNid5B1g2R7v_yjm3lD7L_rpRZpt4wCLcBGAs/s1600/2.gif\" border=\"0\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center;clear:both\"><a href=\"https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/-vIh-9V0WBXc/Ww2EYuTpFNI/AAAAAAAAETc/d5R2Sxs6rkUK5qkIYdyOpEKFSEN5ODMoQCLcBGAs/s1600/4.gif\"